L50: push_constant_string "You seek the grail of old,"
L51: push_constant_string "<br>"
L52: push_constant_string "but no longer is it a goblet of gold."
L53: push_constant_string "<br>"
L54: push_constant_string "Among these nine will you find what you seek,"
L55: push_constant_string "<br>"
L56: push_constant_string "but be careful and don't peek!"
L57: push_constant_string "<br>"
L58: push_constant_string "A wrong choice will expel you,"
L59: push_constant_string "<br>"
